    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269430/extras/1315fef9a1561d39c49e64ef0d603c9c.poster.avif?t=1752684955\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269430/extras/1315fef9a1561d39c49e64ef0d603c9c.webm?t=1752684955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269430/extras/1315fef9a1561d39c49e64ef0d603c9c.mp4?t=1752684955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a candle, slowly melting in real time. Your mission is to explore a series of eerie and atmospheric locations, solving intriguing puzzles along the way. But be quick\u2014time is not on your side! To survive, you\u2019ll need to bend time and space, think creatively, and use every element of your surroundings to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you\u2019ll unravel a gripping tale filled with unexpected twists, betrayal, and... vegetable murders? That\u2019s right! In this bizarre world, you\u2019ll uncover dark secrets, witness berry dismemberment, and experience other absurd yet strangely captivating events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269430/extras/0de3d6815c4867f8e170d5f67b751dc0.poster.avif?t=1752684955\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269430/extras/0de3d6815c4867f8e170d5f67b751dc0.webm?t=1752684955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269430/extras/0de3d6815c4867f8e170d5f67b751dc0.mp4?t=1752684955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time melting mechanic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric locations filled with mysteries and secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time and space manipulation to solve puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unusual story with elements of dark humor and absurdity.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269430/extras/07748c8a88a053effb5c48888eb13140.poster.avif?t=1752684955\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269430/extras/07748c8a88a053effb5c48888eb13140.webm?t=1752684955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269430/extras/07748c8a88a053effb5c48888eb13140.mp4?t=1752684955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You made it to the end? Wow! Most people just watch the trailer. Some check the screenshots. Almost no one reads the description. \u25d5\u203f\u25d5</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have a great day! If you try the game, may your candle burn bright (but not too fast!). And please, add the game to your wishlist. I'm a small indie dev, and it means a lot to me. (\uff61\u25d5\u203f\u203f\u25d5\uff61)</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269430/extras/1315fef9a1561d39c49e64ef0d603c9c.poster.avif?t=1752684955\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269430/extras/1315fef9a1561d39c49e64ef0d603c9c.webm?t=1752684955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269430/extras/1315fef9a1561d39c49e64ef0d603c9c.mp4?t=1752684955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a candle, slowly melting in real time. Your mission is to explore a series of eerie and atmospheric locations, solving intriguing puzzles along the way. But be quick\u2014time is not on your side! To survive, you\u2019ll need to bend time and space, think creatively, and use every element of your surroundings to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you\u2019ll unravel a gripping tale filled with unexpected twists, betrayal, and... vegetable murders? That\u2019s right! In this bizarre world, you\u2019ll uncover dark secrets, witness berry dismemberment, and experience other absurd yet strangely captivating events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269430/extras/0de3d6815c4867f8e170d5f67b751dc0.poster.avif?t=1752684955\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269430/extras/0de3d6815c4867f8e170d5f67b751dc0.webm?t=1752684955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269430/extras/0de3d6815c4867f8e170d5f67b751dc0.mp4?t=1752684955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time melting mechanic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric locations filled with mysteries and secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time and space manipulation to solve puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unusual story with elements of dark humor and absurdity.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269430/extras/07748c8a88a053effb5c48888eb13140.poster.avif?t=1752684955\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269430/extras/07748c8a88a053effb5c48888eb13140.webm?t=1752684955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269430/extras/07748c8a88a053effb5c48888eb13140.mp4?t=1752684955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You made it to the end? Wow! Most people just watch the trailer. Some check the screenshots. Almost no one reads the description. \u25d5\u203f\u25d5</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have a great day! If you try the game, may your candle burn bright (but not too fast!). And please, add the game to your wishlist. I'm a small indie dev, and it means a lot to me. (\uff61\u25d5\u203f\u203f\u25d5\uff61)</p>",
    "short_description": "Candle, your path is full of puzzles. Can you handle it? Hurry, your time is already melting away.",
